---
import { BRAND_CONFIG } from '../config/brand';
---

<section
  id="ficha-tecnica"
  class="relative overflow-hidden bg-canopy-900 py-24 sm:py-32"
  aria-labelledby="tech-specs-heading"
>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6">
    <!-- Section Header -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 items-end gap-8 lg:grid-cols-12">
      <div class="lg:col-span-7">
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-celestial-400/30 bg-celestial-500/15 px-3.5 py-1 text-xs font-bold text-celestial-400">
          Ficha Técnica de Producto · Código Interno {BRAND_CONFIG.internalCode} · Versión {BRAND_CONFIG.version}
        </span>
        <h2
          id="tech-specs-heading"
          class="mt-4 font-display text-3xl leading-[1.06] font-extrabold tracking-tight text-cream-50 sm:text-5xl"
        >
          Economía circular, bioempaque de fibra de piña y respaldo químico.
        </h2>
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 lg:col-span-5 lg:justify-end">
        <button
          id="open-manual-modal-btn"
          type="button"
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 rounded-full bg-bio-500 px-5 py-3 text-xs font-extrabold text-canopy-950 shadow-lg transition-all hover:bg-bio-400 sm:text-sm"
        >
          <svg class="h-4 w-4" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2">
            <path d="M15 3h6v6M9 21H3v-6M21 3l-7 7M3 21l7-7" />
          </svg>
          <span>Inspeccionar Ficha Técnica Oficial</span>
        </button>

        <a
          href="/assets/images/manual_narayana.png"
          download="Ficha_Tecnica_Narayana_NRN-001.png"
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-bio-400/30 bg-canopy-950 px-5 py-3 text-xs font-bold text-cream-50 transition-colors hover:border-bio-400 hover:text-bio-400 sm:text-sm"
        >
          <svg class="h-4 w-4" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2">
            <path d="M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4M7 10l5 5 5-5M12 15V3" />
          </svg>
          <span>Descargar NRN-001</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 3 Circular Economy Highlight Cards (10. Información Ambiental) -->
    <div class="mt-12 grid grid-cols-1 gap-5 md:grid-cols-3">
      <div class="rounded-3xl border border-bio-400/20 bg-canopy-800/70 p-6">
        <span class="inline-flex rounded-xl bg-bio-500/20 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-bold text-bio-400">
          Agro-Innovación Circular
        </span>
        <h3 class="mt-3 font-display text-xl font-bold text-cream-50">
          Fibra de piña para bioempaque
        </h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-xs leading-relaxed text-cream-100/80">
          El proceso de producción de Narayana promueve la economía circular y el aprovechamiento de residuos agrícolas regionales como la fibra de piña para el desarrollo de bioempaques sostenibles.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="rounded-3xl border border-bio-400/20 bg-canopy-800/70 p-6">
        <span class="inline-flex rounded-xl bg-celestial-500/20 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-bold text-celestial-400">
          Polipropileno (PP) Reciclable
        </span>
        <h3 class="mt-3 font-display text-xl font-bold text-cream-50">
          Envase reutilizable de larga vida
        </h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-xs leading-relaxed text-cream-100/80">
          Pote ergonómico con tapa rosca hermética fabricado en Polipropileno (PP) 100% reciclable y reutilizable, diseñado para conservar la humedad ≤ 3% durante sus 24 meses de vida útil.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="rounded-3xl border border-bio-400/20 bg-canopy-800/70 p-6">
        <span class="inline-flex rounded-xl bg-bio-500/20 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-bold text-bio-400">
          Compromiso Narayana
        </span>
        <h3 class="mt-3 font-display text-xl font-bold text-cream-50">
          Limpieza efectiva, planeta protegido
        </h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-xs leading-relaxed text-cream-100/80">
          Fórmula de alta biodegradabilidad y 100% libre de fosfatos que protege las fuentes hídricas sin sacrificar potencia desengrasante industrial ni doméstica.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Physico-Chemical Table + Logistics & Official Sheet Preview -->
    <div class="mt-10 grid grid-cols-1 gap-8 lg:grid-cols-12">
      <!-- Left 6 Cols: 3. Características Fisicoquímicas -->
      <div class="rounded-[2rem] border border-bio-400/20 bg-canopy-950/85 p-6 shadow-xl sm:p-7 lg:col-span-6">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-bio-400/15 pb-4">
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-cream-50">
              3. Características Fisicoquímicas
            </h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-cream-200/70">
              Parámetros validados en laboratorio · Solución al 1%
            </p>
          </div>
          <span class="rounded-full bg-bio-500/20 px-3 py-1 font-wordmark text-xs font-bold text-bio-400">
            pH 10,5 – 11,5
          </span>
        </div>

        <dl class="mt-4 divide-y divide-bio-400/10">
          {
            BRAND_CONFIG.physicoChemicalSpecs.map((row) => (
              <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2 py-3 text-xs sm:text-sm">
                <dt class="font-medium text-cream-200/80">{row.parameter}</dt>
                <dd
                  class={`text-right font-semibold ${
                    row.highlight ? 'text-bio-400' : 'text-cream-50'
                  }`}
                >
                  {row.specification}
                </dd>
              </div>
            ))
          }
        </dl>
      </div>

      <!-- Right 6 Cols: 12. Información Logística + Thumbnail Preview of manual_narayana.png -->
      <div class="flex flex-col justify-between gap-6 lg:col-span-6">
        <div class="rounded-[2rem] border border-bio-400/20 bg-canopy-950/85 p-6 shadow-xl sm:p-7">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-bio-400/15 pb-4">
            <div>
              <h3 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-cream-50">
                12. Información Logística (B2B & Hogar)
              </h3>
              <p class="text-xs text-cream-200/70">
                Especificaciones de empaque y distribución mayorista
              </p>
            </div>
            <span class="rounded-full bg-celestial-500/20 px-3 py-1 font-wordmark text-xs font-bold text-celestial-400">
              {BRAND_CONFIG.internalCode}
            </span>
          </div>

          <dl class="mt-4 divide-y divide-bio-400/10">
            {
              BRAND_CONFIG.logisticSpecs.map((row) => (
                <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2 py-2.5 text-xs sm:text-sm">
                  <dt class="font-medium text-cream-200/80">{row.parameter}</dt>
                  <dd class="text-right font-semibold text-cream-50">{row.specification}</dd>
                </div>
              ))
            }
          </dl>
        </div>

        <!-- Interactive Preview Card for manual_narayana.png -->
        <div
          id="preview-manual-card"
          class="group relative cursor-pointer overflow-hidden rounded-[2rem] border border-bio-400/30 bg-canopy-950 p-4 transition-all hover:border-bio-400"
        >
          <div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-4 sm:flex-row">
            <div class="relative h-28 w-full shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl sm:w-44">
              <img
                src="/assets/images/manual_narayana.png"
                alt="Vista previa de la Ficha Técnica Oficial de Producto Narayana NRN-001"
                loading="lazy"
                class="h-full w-full object-cover transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-105"
              />
            </div>
            <div class="flex-1">
              <span class="text-[11px] font-bold tracking-wider text-bio-400 uppercase">
                Documento Oficial Completo
              </span>
              <h4 class="mt-0.5 font-display text-lg font-bold text-cream-50">
                Ver Ficha Técnica Original en Alta Resolución
              </h4>
              <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-cream-100/80">
                Incluye los 12 bloques oficiales: descripción, composición, beneficios, precauciones, almacenamiento e información ambiental.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- High-Res Modal for Official Technical Sheet (manual_narayana.png) -->
  <div
    id="manual-modal"
    class="fixed inset-0 z-[110] hidden items-center justify-center bg-canopy-950/90 p-4 backdrop-blur-md sm:p-6"
    role="dialog"
    aria-modal="true"
    aria-labelledby="manual-modal-title"
  >
    <div
      class="relative flex max-h-[92vh] w-full max-w-6xl flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-bio-400/30 bg-canopy-900 shadow-2xl"
    >
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-bio-400/20 px-5 py-4">
        <div>
          <h3 id="manual-modal-title" class="font-display text-lg font-bold text-cream-50">
            Ficha Técnica de Producto Narayana · Código {BRAND_CONFIG.internalCode}
          </h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-cream-200/75">
            Puedes hacer zoom o descargar el archivo original para tu empresa o punto de venta
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <a
            href="/assets/images/manual_narayana.png"
            download="Ficha_Tecnica_Narayana_NRN-001.png"
            class="rounded-full bg-bio-500 px-4 py-2 text-xs font-extrabold text-canopy-950 hover:bg-bio-400"
          >
            Descargar PNG
          </a>
          <button
            id="close-manual-modal-btn"
            type="button"
            class="flex h-9 w-9 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-white/20 bg-canopy-950 text-cream-50 hover:border-bio-400"
            aria-label="Cerrar visor de ficha técnica"
          >
            ✕
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="overflow-auto p-4 sm:p-6" data-lenis-prevent>
        <img
          src="/assets/images/manual_narayana.png"
          alt="Ficha Técnica Oficial Narayana Limpiador Multiusos en Crema NRN-001 completa"
          class="mx-auto h-auto max-w-full rounded-xl shadow-lg"
        />
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<script>
  const openBtn = document.getElementById('open-manual-modal-btn');
  const previewCard = document.getElementById('preview-manual-card');
  const closeBtn = document.getElementById('close-manual-modal-btn');
  const modal = document.getElementById('manual-modal');

  const toggleModal = (show: boolean) => {
    if (!modal) return;
    modal.classList.toggle('hidden', !show);
    modal.classList.toggle('flex', show);
  };

  openBtn?.addEventListener('click', () => toggleModal(true));
  previewCard?.addEventListener('click', () => toggleModal(true));
  closeBtn?.addEventListener('click', () => toggleModal(false));
  modal?.addEventListener('click', (e) => {
    if (e.target === modal) toggleModal(false);
  });
  document.addEventListener('keydown', (e) => {
    if (e.key === 'Escape') toggleModal(false);
  });
</script>
